Subject: [PATCH] Drop sandbox and refactor

Replace scattered config with a frozen Settings dataclass built from CLI
args (one --ip derives both URLs; AirSim port from settings.json). Move
to an app factory + cli.py, and drop the bwrap sandbox, .runtime copies,
and env overrides from the launch path.

Breaking changes:

    --host, --xpra-url, --airsim-host   ->  --ip
    --port                              ->  --http-port
    --tcp-port                          ->  --xpra-port
    SCENE_* environment variables       ->  command line only
    gunicorn app:app                    ->  python app.py
